.TH sway-things-clipboard-pick 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-clipboard\-pick \- Show the history in the launcher that is installed (fuzzel, wofi, rofi, tofi or bemenu) and copy the entry you pick again; the history key runs this
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things clipboard pick\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the history in the launcher that is installed (fuzzel, wofi, rofi, tofi or bemenu) and copy the entry you pick again; the history key runs this
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
